    {
      "id": "2026-11-25-toolbar-overlay-soft-keyboard-up",
      "kind": "new",
      "summary": "The new `softKeyboardUp()` returns `true` while the on-screen keyboard is up. It reads the browser's virtual keyboard when the browser reports it, and otherwise compares the visual viewport with the tallest one seen at the current width while a `ToolbarOverlayProvider` is mounted.",
